Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.13,0:02:16.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,師父
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.38,0:02:17.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我想學
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.25,0:02:19.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,太子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.63,0:02:24.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,國師
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.69,0:02:27.15,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你又睡著了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.25,0:02:29.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,罰抄十遍道德經
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.92,0:02:30.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,道德經
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.00,0:02:33.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那還不如繞皇城跑十圈呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.67,0:02:34.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,二十遍
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.88,0:02:35.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,現在就抄
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.29,0:02:37.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,字寫好看點
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.75,0:02:39.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.42,0:02:40.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,師父
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.00,0:02:51.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,做什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.00,0:02:53.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,師父
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.79,0:02:55.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我想學新的劍法
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.67,0:02:56.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,之前的都學會了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.88,0:02:57.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,嗯嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.79,0:02:59.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.25,0:03:01.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你想學什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.38,0:03:06.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我想學你救我的那招
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.42,0:03:09.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那招並不實用
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.88,0:03:10.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,至少
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.04,0:03:12.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不適合你學
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.79,0:03:14.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不是很有用嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.29,0:03:16.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,一劍化去兩劍的勁力
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.25,0:03:17.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這才救了我呀
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.88,0:03:21.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,太子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.25,0:03:23.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我問你一個問題
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.92,0:03:24.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你問
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.75,0:03:28.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,如果你前面有兩個人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.63,0:03:29.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他們都餓得不行
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.54,0:03:32.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,為了搶奪對方的食物
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.63,0:03:33.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,互相廝打
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.38,0:03:36.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這個時候第三個人出現了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.75,0:03:38.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他勸這兩個人不要打了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.75,0:03:40.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你覺得
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.25,0:03:42.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,結果會如何
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.38,0:03:44.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,畢竟餓肚子嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.92,0:03:46.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,勸肯定沒用
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.04,0:03:47.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.15,0:03:50.73,Dialog,,0,0,0,,光講大道理
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.92,0:03:52.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,糧食也不會因此多出一份
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.38,0:03:55.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,所以
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.38,0:03:56.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,若想停止紛爭
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.67,0:04:00.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這第三人便只能將二人之外的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.92,0:04:02.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,自己的糧食分給他們
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.54,0:04:05.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,而我那招也是如此
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.04,0:04:08.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你說我憑空化去了兩劍的勁力
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.54,0:04:09.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,其實並不正確
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.63,0:04:11.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你要知道
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.88,0:04:12.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,利劍出鞘
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.04,0:04:14.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,勢不可擋
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.17,0:04:16.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就必然要有東西去承接其力
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.88,0:04:18.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,物或者人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.38,0:04:20.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,而兩劍相爭
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.00,0:04:22.21,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這第三人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.21,0:04:24.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,正是以己之身去承受前者的攻擊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.50,0:04:27.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,止干戈而自承其傷
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.63,0:04:30.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你貴為太子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.38,0:04:32.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這種愚蠢的招數更沒有必要學
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.00,0:04:33.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.88,0:04:41.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,還有什麼問題嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.75,0:04:43.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,師父
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.17,0:04:47.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,如果那第三個人的糧食也不夠怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.50,0:04:51.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,如果那兩個人有了糧食
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.13,0:04:53.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,卻因為貪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.29,0:04:54.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,想要更多
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.29,0:04:55.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,打得更凶
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.75,0:04:58.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不斷向第三個人索取糧食
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.00,0:04:59.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那又該怎麼辦啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.00,0:05:03.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,太子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.88,0:05:05.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你覺得呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.00,0:05:08.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.79,0:05:10.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,也許
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.29,0:05:13.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,從一開始就不應該插手吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.13,0:05:30.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,國師
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.67,0:05:32.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,太子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.63,0:05:33.46,Dialog,,0,0,0,,快點
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.38,0:05:35.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,-來了\N-千秋
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.67,0:05:37.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,千秋
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.17,0:05:43.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,國師
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.50,0:05:47.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.29,0:05:48.33,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.25,0:05:49.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,發生
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.75,0:05:51.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,發生了什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.13,0:05:59.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,父皇
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.25,0:06:01.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,母后
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.63,0:06:07.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎麼會這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.67,0:06:11.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這不是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.79,0:06:13.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,父皇
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.13,0:06:14.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,母后
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.25,0:06:18.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,師父
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.54,0:06:20.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你這是在幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.63,0:06:22.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你幹了什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.00,0:06:26.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,國師
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.13,0:06:41.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你承認了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.92,0:06:44.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那很好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.50,0:06:46.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不知這次會怎麼發落啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.42,0:06:47.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,說不好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.54,0:06:48.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,想當初
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.54,0:06:50.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,帝君可是對他青睞有加呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.63,0:06:51.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那是剛開始
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.79,0:06:52.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,第二次飛升
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.75,0:06:54.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,兩人不是打了一場嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.38,0:06:55.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,對對對
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.29,0:06:57.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,仙樂太子還捅了帝君好幾劍吶
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.75,0:06:59.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這仇肯定結下了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.00,0:07:00.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可你看看那新批的仙樂宮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.88,0:07:02.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,仙京最好的地段
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.25,0:07:03.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哪像有仇
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.13,0:07:06.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這仙樂太子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.29,0:07:08.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,難不成
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.88,0:07:10.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,靠山硬啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.42,0:07:13.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,仙樂有個不情之請
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.38,0:07:14.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你說
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.29,0:07:16.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,請帝君去我仙籍
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.50,0:07:18.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,貶我下凡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.42,0:07:19.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.17,0:07:19.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.88,0:07:22.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這種請求還第一次見
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.29,0:07:23.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,飛升是你的本事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.67,0:07:24.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你不需要自貶
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.88,0:07:26.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我只要你跟我打一場
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.29,0:07:27.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,但
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.17,0:07:27.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我不想
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.79,0:07:28.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.50,0:07:31.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你以前也不是沒跟我打過
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.67,0:07:32.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.13,0:07:33.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,跟我打
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.50,0:07:35.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你必輸無疑
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.04,0:07:39.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我說了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.00,0:07:39.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不論生死
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.63,0:07:40.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就此了結
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.63,0:07:41.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我不需要你讓我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.04,0:07:44.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,請帝君貶我下界
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.63,0:07:45.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.25,0:07:45.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,且慢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.79,0:07:46.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,帝君
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.50,0:07:47.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我還有話
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.25,0:07:52.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,諸位仙僚
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.88,0:07:55.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,若仙樂殿下真是為報復才化名芳心
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.67,0:07:57.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,血洗永安皇室的話
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.50,0:07:58.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那麼為何
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.50,0:08:01.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,獨獨放過了身為永安太子的泰華殿下呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.04,0:08:02.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,照理說
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.00,0:08:04.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他最想手刃的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.50,0:08:07.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不就應該是這位永安國的太子殿下嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.75,0:08:09.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我雖與仙樂殿下相交時短
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.13,0:08:12.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,但也親眼見他為救泰華殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.67,0:08:14.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,正面迎擊彎刀厄命
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.75,0:08:15.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,受此重傷
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.04,0:08:17.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,千秋
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.38,0:08:20.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他若是真對永安皇室有恨
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.88,0:08:22.96,Dialog,,0,0,0,,又怎會冒險去替你擋下這一刀呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.96,0:08:23.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這可不一定
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.54,0:08:25.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,說不定是因為心虛愧疚
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.00,0:08:25.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.54,0:08:26.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那可是不祥邪兵
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.75,0:08:27.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,詛咒之刃吶
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.50,0:08:29.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,在座的諸位
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.00,0:08:30.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,除了帝君
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.00,0:08:34.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有誰敢說接上這麼一擊能全身而退
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.25,0:08:40.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,所以
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.13,0:08:41.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我認為此事存疑
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.67,0:08:43.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,請帝君明察
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.29,0:08:47.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,真羨慕太子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.00,0:08:49.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,能得風師大人一力擔保
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.13,0:08:50.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,仗義執言
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.13,0:08:54.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我們家小裴可就沒這個福分了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.38,0:08:57.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,裴將軍可不要混淆視聽
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.50,0:08:59.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,小裴的事能一樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.29,0:09:01.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我可是親眼見他惡行
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.13,0:09:02.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,親耳聽他承認了的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.88,0:09:05.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那今日泰華殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.50,0:09:07.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不也是親眼見仙樂殿下惡行
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.79,0:09:09.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,親耳聽他承認了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.75,0:09:13.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這麼說來確實如此啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.00,0:09:16.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這跟小裴將軍情況難道不一樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.50,0:09:17.08,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他自己都承認了的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.08,0:09:17.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.17,0:09:19.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,風師大人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.79,0:09:20.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,多謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.79,0:09:21.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我承你的情
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.17,0:09:23.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不過不必了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.13,0:09:24.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,諸位稍安勿躁
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.63,0:09:27.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,泰華
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.38,0:09:29.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你行事素來有些衝動
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.92,0:09:32.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,但遇事須得冷靜處之
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.25,0:09:33.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,辨清來龍去脈後
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.79,0:09:34.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,再做定奪
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.42,0:09:37.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.17,0:09:37.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,帝君
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.54,0:09:39.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,仙樂
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.00,0:09:41.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你既然不肯全盤托出
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.29,0:09:44.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,便先收押在仙樂宮禁足
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.88,0:09:47.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,之後我會親自審問
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.63,0:09:48.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,在那之前
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.00,0:09:50.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你們先不要見面了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.00,0:09:51.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.88,0:09:52.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,帝君
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.50,0:09:55.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,帝君英明
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.50,0:09:58.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,帝君想問什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.67,0:09:59.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可以盡管審
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.29,0:10:02.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,但無論最終結果如何
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.54,0:10:04.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我誓與你決一死戰
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.92,0:10:05.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,告退
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.63,0:10:11.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,風師大人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.38,0:10:13.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可否拜託你兩件事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.63,0:10:15.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你講
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.42,0:10:18.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我鬼市帶上來的那個少年
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.42,0:10:22.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,勞煩你照看一下了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.54,0:10:24.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,小事一樁
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.63,0:10:25.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,第二件呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.29,0:10:27.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,若是裴將軍之後
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.67,0:10:29.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,還想找半月發難
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.63,0:10:31.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,還請風師大人施以援手
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.67,0:10:32.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,放心
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.67,0:10:34.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我是不會讓裴將軍得手的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.63,0:10:35.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,她在哪啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.38,0:10:36.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,一個醃菜罈子裡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.13,0:10:38.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,醃菜罈子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.29,0:10:40.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,醃菜罈子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.88,0:10:41.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.13,0:10:43.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,放菩薺觀裡了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.67,0:10:44.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你有空
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.75,0:10:46.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,勞煩把她取出來吹一吹
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.25,0:10:49.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,太子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.13,0:10:49.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,請吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.75,0:10:51.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有勞了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.50,0:11:12.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,第一次進來就是被禁足
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.04,0:11:14.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這兆頭可真不怎麼樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.92,0:11:23.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,果然
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.50,0:11:27.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,連殿內設施都和從前那座仙樂宮一模一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.67,0:11:45.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.13,0:11:47.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不知怎樣了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.42,0:11:58.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,之後被貶下凡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.92,0:12:01.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,砸鍋賣鐵也得把極樂坊給賠上
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.13,0:12:03.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,幾十年
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.88,0:12:04.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,幾百年
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.17,0:12:06.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,大不了一輩子都折給他
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.13,0:12:10.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎的骰子還在
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.38,0:12:21.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,果然
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.75,0:12:23.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,借來的運氣是已經耗盡了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.42,0:12:32.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎麼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.50,0:12:33.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,以為會是風信
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.88,0:12:36.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他大概是不會來了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.50,0:12:38.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你這是來
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.38,0:12:41.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,帝君是禁了你的足
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.29,0:12:44.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,也不准泰華殿下過來
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.29,0:12:45.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,但可沒說我不能來
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.63,0:12:59.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你那右手老這麼血淋淋拖著
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.92,0:13:00.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怪不好看的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.04,0:13:04.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你愛用不用
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.13,0:13:05.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,反正也沒人會再送過來了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.67,0:13:07.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,確實
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.13,0:13:10.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,雖然帝君替我應急處理過
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.25,0:13:11.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,手能動了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.00,0:13:13.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不過有藥好更快些
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.00,0:13:25.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,果然是好物
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.38,0:13:26.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,謝了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.25,0:13:26.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.42,0:13:29.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,真的殺了那些永安國的皇族
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.67,0:13:30.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你是怎麼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.25,0:13:31.21,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你在這裡幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.96,0:13:35.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎麼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.63,0:13:37.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這裡又不是你的殿
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.25,0:13:39.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你能來我就不能來
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.13,0:13:41.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.00,0:13:43.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,剛才在神武殿的那些話
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.88,0:13:44.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.50,0:13:52.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,今天我在神武殿上所說的每一句話
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.50,0:13:53.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,都是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.88,0:13:55.71,Dialog,,0,0,0,,行了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.71,0:13:56.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你就收著點吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.92,0:13:59.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,事到如今這副沉痛臉又是做給誰看
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.50,0:14:00.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,反正沒做給你看
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.92,0:14:01.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,滾出去
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.88,0:14:04.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你倒是有資格叫我滾
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.04,0:14:06.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,嘴上說的有多衷心
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.75,0:14:10.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,還不是熬不了幾年就自己跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.63,0:14:11.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,打住
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.38,0:14:12.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,打住
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.29,0:14:15.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,人人都說你是深明大義不忍見故主墮落
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.92,0:14:17.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,還不都是藉口
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.75,0:14:18.58,Dialog,,0,0,0,,-說穿了\N-你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.63,0:14:21.71,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你就是不想再和一個廢人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.71,0:14:23.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,虛度光陰了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.04,0:14:24.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你懂個屁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.50,0:14:28.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,風信
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.25,0:14:30.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,慕情
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.50,0:14:33.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你們
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.50,0:14:38.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你以為誰都和你一樣齷齪
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.25,0:14:40.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,巴不得他壞事做絕你就高興了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.54,0:14:43.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你一向瞧不起我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.29,0:14:45.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可你看看你自己
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.92,0:14:47.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不過是五十步笑百步罷了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.75,0:14:51.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,好了好了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.29,0:15:01.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎麼就真打起來了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.13,0:15:03.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這倆以前不是這樣的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.75,0:15:07.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,慕情從來講話都是細聲細氣
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.25,0:15:09.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,-絕對不會跟人對著吼\N-今天我就讓你好看
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.54,0:15:12.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,-風信也是從來都聽我的話\N-一會兒被我揍得
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.38,0:15:14.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,-讓打就打讓停就停\N-滿地找牙的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.17,0:15:15.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你可別跪下來跟我求饒
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.79,0:15:18.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,都長大了拉不住了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.54,0:15:21.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,還是找外援吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.63,0:15:39.46,Dialog,,0,0,0,,盾開
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.38,0:15:43.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.13,0:15:44.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不要站在那裡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.13,0:15:45.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,快到盾後面來
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.88,0:15:52.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不要用手碰那玩意
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.25,0:15:53.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,很危險
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.13,0:15:53.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.88,0:15:55.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不會啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.92,0:15:57.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,明明挺可愛的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.67,0:16:04.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.88,0:16:21.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.88,0:16:24.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你好大的膽子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.50,0:16:25.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,竟敢來仙京劫人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.38,0:16:27.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,未免太猖狂了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.67,0:16:28.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,快放開殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.42,0:16:29.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,彼此彼此
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.92,0:16:32.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你們神官在我的地盤不也挺猖狂的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.50,0:16:34.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我說了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.50,0:16:35.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,把人放下
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.88,0:16:41.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那就看你們有沒有這個本事了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.88,0:16:43.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,血雨探花
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.42,0:16:45.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.54,0:16:54.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.17,0:16:54.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎麼會
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.54,0:16:55.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.25,0:16:56.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.25,0:16:58.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,風信
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.79,0:16:59.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎麼了 怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.67,0:17:00.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,出什麼事了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.63,0:17:02.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,什麼事需要吼這麼大聲
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.50,0:17:03.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,耳膜都要炸裂了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.92,0:17:04.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.75,0:17:05.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哪個殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.25,0:17:07.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,南陽將軍
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.38,0:17:08.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,出什麼事了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.75,0:17:09.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,出事了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.67,0:17:10.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,快通報帝君
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.67,0:17:11.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,謝憐跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.42,0:17:13.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.54,0:17:14.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我去看看
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.88,0:17:19.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,仙樂宮外不是一堆小神官看著的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.38,0:17:20.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,只能進不能出的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.63,0:17:21.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎麼會跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.17,0:17:23.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,什麼跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.00,0:17:23.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你少添亂
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.13,0:17:25.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就是跑了呀
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.29,0:17:26.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,跟人跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.29,0:17:27.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,胡說八道
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.13,0:17:28.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那是被人劫走了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.92,0:17:29.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,劫走了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.38,0:17:31.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這裡可是仙京
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.42,0:17:32.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,誰人這麼囂張
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.17,0:17:32.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.92,0:17:34.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,誰敢在帝君眼皮底下劫人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.54,0:17:37.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,人人人真沒了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.04,0:17:38.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我剛聽靈文殿的小官說
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.54,0:17:39.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,仙樂宮空了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.75,0:17:40.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.50,0:17:41.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎麼可能
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.29,0:17:42.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,千真萬確啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.75,0:17:43.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.63,0:17:45.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你還聽不聽得到我們說話
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.25,0:17:46.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你現在在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.50,0:17:47.08,Dialog,,0,0,0,,膽大包天
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.08,0:17:48.96,Dialog,,0,0,0,,-殿下 殿下\N-當我們大小天神是擺設啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.96,0:17:50.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,-你聽得到我們說話嗎\N-往哪個方向跑了 我們去追
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.00,0:17:51.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,諸位鎮定
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.50,0:18:00.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,許久不見
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.88,0:18:01.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,各位
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.17,0:18:03.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.17,0:18:08.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.54,0:18:09.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你們有沒有想我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.88,0:18:12.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,反正我是一點也沒有想你們
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.50,0:18:16.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不過
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.63,0:18:18.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我最近確實有點閒
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.13,0:18:21.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,也有段時間沒跟各位切磋切磋了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.63,0:18:24.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,要是有人正巧也閒得慌
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.63,0:18:26.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,想過來找我挑戰敘舊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.13,0:18:29.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那也是熱烈歡迎的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.88,0:18:30.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我靠
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.75,0:18:32.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.88,0:18:33.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.25,0:18:37.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,別理他們了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.00,0:18:38.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.25,0:18:40.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,跟我走
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.17,0:18:46.58,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎這是為了救我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.88,0:18:47.58,Dialog,,0,0,0,,才
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.63,0:19:02.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.29,0:19:08.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我憑什麼覺得三郎是來救我的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.67,0:19:20.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我才燒了極樂坊和兵器庫
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.50,0:19:23.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎自然應該是來興師問罪的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.63,0:19:25.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.38,0:19:27.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.67,0:19:29.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,為何要說對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.17,0:19:32.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你對我知無不言
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.17,0:19:35.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我卻隱瞞了查地師失蹤之事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.75,0:19:36.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,騙了你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.75,0:19:38.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你盛情款待
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.63,0:19:41.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我卻燒了你的極樂坊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.54,0:19:44.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,還有那全是珍品的兵器庫
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.79,0:19:47.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我好生過意不去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.50,0:19:51.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不過我馬上要被貶了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.29,0:19:53.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,下來之後一定想辦法補償你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.79,0:19:55.21,Dialog,,0,0,0,,-看怎麼樣才能彌補損失\N-為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.88,0:20:03.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你為什麼要補償我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.13,0:20:05.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,明明是我傷了你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.50,0:20:06.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不是你傷了我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.50,0:20:09.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你忘了我一刀震傷了你一條手臂
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.75,0:20:11.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你說右手啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.71,0:20:13.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,沒事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.42,0:20:14.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不痛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.04,0:20:14.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你看
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.67,0:20:15.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,還能動
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.25,0:20:17.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我害你受那麼重的傷
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.13,0:20:19.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,為什麼你還能笑著跟我說對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.54,0:20:22.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,還反過來說要補償我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.17,0:20:23.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.54,0:20:24.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.67,0:20:26.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是我自己上去迎擊才受的傷
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.54,0:20:29.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,本來就怨不得你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.33,0:20:38.46,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎
